{"file": "来自未来的女儿-第70集.mp4", "ep": 70, "duration": 57.0, "segments": [{"start": 0.02, "end": 0.82, "text": "什么"}, {"start": 1.46, "end": 2.9, "text": "她竟然给她生孩子了"}, {"start": 3.74, "end": 4.78, "text": "只要没结婚"}, {"start": 4.9, "end": 6.42, "text": "我就有机会当孩子的吧"}, {"start": 6.86, "end": 8.07, "text": "幸运的"}, {"start": 8.43, "end": 9.95, "text": "是你说放火再去救她"}, {"start": 10.07, "end": 10.87, "text": "你的火呢"}, {"start": 11.11, "end": 12.27, "text": "那么漂亮的脸蛋"}, {"start": 12.43, "end": 13.43, "text": "我再多看两眼"}, {"start": 13.67, "end": 14.27, "text": "还有你"}, {"start": 14.59, "end": 15.47, "text": "林大小姐"}, {"start": 15.71, "end": 16.67, "text": "她是我的"}, {"start": 31.11, "end": 31.63, "text": "宝宝"}, {"start": 31.83, "end": 32.71, "text": "你做完拉杜杜"}, {"start": 32.83, "end": 33.83, "text": "暂时还不能吃"}, {"start": 33.99, "end": 34.83, "text": "马上回新家"}, {"start": 34.95, "end": 35.99, "text": "妈妈准备了好吃的"}, {"start": 36.15, "end": 36.99, "text": "等我们好了再喝"}, {"start": 37.11, "end": 37.59, "text": "不哭了"}, {"start": 37.83, "end": 40.35, "text": "宝宝 叉叉叉"}, {"start": 40.47, "end": 49.57, "text": "宝宝嘴巴没有啊"}, {"start": 49.69, "end": 50.25, "text": "姐姐"}, {"start": 50.37, "end": 52.05, "text": "宝宝 吃一嘴啊"}, {"start": 53.06, "end": 53.54, "text": "不好意思"}, {"start": 53.66, "end": 54.18, "text": "打扰了"}, {"start": 54.3, "end": 54.86, "text": "吃饭了"}]}